WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.578 --> 00:00:03.257
CREW
Ready and action!

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:07.922
COBIE SMULDERS
When we start Secret Invasion,

00:00:07.973 --> 00:00:10.773
Nick Fury has been off planet and

00:00:10.824 --> 00:00:15.354
Maria Hill has just really been
trying to you know, maintain order.

00:00:15.418 --> 00:00:17.376
But this current threat
is getting out of control.

00:00:17.427 --> 00:00:19.405
AGENT PRESCOTT
Five global terrorist strikes

00:00:19.456 --> 00:00:23.217
within the past year, each one
claimed by a different group.

00:00:23.359 --> 00:00:24.633
EVERETT ROSS
It's business as usual.

00:00:24.684 --> 00:00:26.471
AGENT PRESCOTT
That's precisely what they

00:00:26.522 --> 00:00:27.471
want you to think.

00:00:30.202 --> 00:00:33.873
SAMUEL L. JACKSON
Nick comes back having lost

00:00:33.924 --> 00:00:36.286
whatever power he had before.

00:00:36.337 --> 00:00:41.108
So, we try and solve things
without being too superhuman.

00:00:41.159 --> 00:00:42.276
ART GALLERY OWNER
Are you going to shoot me?

00:00:42.481 --> 00:00:44.769
NICK FURY
Maybe. Oh, probably.

00:00:46.088 --> 00:00:46.889
But not right now.

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:49.574
COBIE SMULDERS
We get to jump into Nick Fury's world,

00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:51.401
which is very spy versus spy.

00:00:51.581 --> 00:00:54.233
BEN MENDELSOHN
The kind of grittiness, the locations,

00:00:54.284 --> 00:00:57.530
the way it feels, the way
it's written. It's a thriller.

00:00:59.039 --> 00:01:02.754
TALOS
Fury, we gotta be very careful now.

00:01:03.519 --> 00:01:05.417
ALI SELIM
I had to pinch myself many mornings

00:01:05.468 --> 00:01:08.956
when I would step on set with
Olivia Colman, Sam Jackson,

00:01:09.007 --> 00:01:13.206
Don Cheadle, Emilia Clarke,
Ben Mendelsohn, Kingsley Ben-Adir.

00:01:13.257 --> 00:01:15.144
I mean, some of my favorite
actors in the world.

00:01:15.194 --> 00:01:16.396
SONYA FALSWORTH
Alone at Last.

00:01:16.447 --> 00:01:18.507
OLIVIA COLMAN
After every Marvel film released,

00:01:18.558 --> 00:01:21.686
I would phone my agent and say,
"Please, can I be in a Marvel thing?"

00:01:21.737 --> 00:01:22.944
I never imagined it would happen.

00:01:23.015 --> 00:01:23.827
[Groan]

00:01:23.878 --> 00:01:24.804
GOON
What makes you think

00:01:24.855 --> 00:01:26.101
you can get him to speak?

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:27.896
SONYA FALSWORTH
Oh, I can be quite persuasive.

00:01:29.257 --> 00:01:30.765
DON CHEADLE
Looking at the MCU through these

00:01:30.815 --> 00:01:34.045
different lenses, you get to see all
these different sides of the characters.

00:01:34.096 --> 00:01:36.433
So, we get to really sort
of dig into who they are.

00:01:36.484 --> 00:01:37.339
NICK FURY
How much do you know about

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:38.714
your security detail?

00:01:39.814 --> 00:01:40.886
JAMES RHODES
What do you mean, how much

00:01:40.937 --> 00:01:41.792
do I know about it?

00:01:42.912 --> 00:01:45.041
EMILIA CLARKE
This idea of who can you trust?

00:01:45.092 --> 00:01:47.124
That is really the heart of the show.

00:01:47.869 --> 00:01:49.010
COBIE SMULDERS
It could be talking to somebody

00:01:49.061 --> 00:01:52.832
you have a very close relationship
with, and then you find out that

00:01:52.883 --> 00:01:54.996
that's not who you thought it was.

00:01:57.131 --> 00:01:59.245
DON CHEADLE
It becomes sort of a cat and mouse game

00:01:59.296 --> 00:02:01.672
that we build toward to
the end of the show.

00:02:03.373 --> 00:02:04.600
EMILIA CLARKE
You can't predict it,

00:02:04.651 --> 00:02:06.181
and you can't preempt it.

00:02:06.365 --> 00:02:08.887
And you can't fathom it
until it happens.

00:02:09.409 --> 00:02:10.470
NICK FURY
I'm Nick Fury.

00:02:11.266 --> 00:02:13.258
Even when I'm out, I'm in.

